# 数据库监控系统API测试文件
# 可以在IntelliJ IDEA中直接运行这些HTTP请求

### 1. 测试基本健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. 测试警告发送接口（JSON参数）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/alert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senduser": "admin",
  "token": "test-token-123",
  "content": "这是一个测试警告消息",
  "webhookUrl": "http://localhost:8080/api/test/webhook"
}

### 3. 测试数据库断开警告
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/test-db-disconnect
Accept: application/json

### 4. 测试数据库重连警告
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/test-db-reconnect
Accept: application/json

### 5. 测试Critical级别警告
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/test-severity/critical
Accept: application/json

### 6. 测试Warning级别警告
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/test-severity/warning
Accept: application/json

### 7. 测试Info级别警告
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/test-severity/info
Accept: application/json

### 8. 检查所有数据源状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/check/all
Accept: application/json

### 9. 获取详细监控状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/status/detailed
Accept: application/json

### 10. 系统健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/system-health
Accept: application/json

### 11. 综合状态检查（数据库+系统）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/status/comprehensive
Accept: application/json

### 12. 动态调整监控间隔
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/schedule/primary-db?interval=30
Accept: application/json

### 13. 手动触发定时健康报告（测试定时任务）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/trigger-scheduled-report
Accept: application/json

### 14. 获取定时报告配置信息
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/scheduled-report-info
Accept: application/json

### 15. 测试完整的警告工作流程
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/alert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senduser": "test-operator",
  "token": "workflow-test-456",
  "content": "测试完整警告工作流程：HTTP协议自动添加、分级发送、状态变化检测",
  "webhookUrl": "webhook.example.com/alerts",
  "severity": "warning"
}

### 16. 测试长时间SQL检测功能
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/check/primary-db
Accept: application/json

### 17. 测试分级报警功能
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/test-severity/critical
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "测试Critical级别：数据库完全无法连接",
  "additionalInfo": {
    "testType": "critical-level-test",
    "recipients": [
      "admin",
      "oncall-engineer"
    ]
  }
}

### 18. 测试定时报告功能说明
# 定时报告将在以下时间自动执行：
# - 每小时的第5分钟（00:05, 01:05, 02:05, ...）
# - 每小时的第35分钟（00:35, 01:35, 02:35, ...）
# 
# 报告内容包括：
# 1. Java程序状态检查 (INFO级别) - 报告程序正常运行
# 2. MySQL连接状态 (INFO/CRITICAL级别) - 检查所有数据库连接
# 3. 长时间SQL分析 (INFO/WARNING/CRITICAL级别) - 检查超过30分钟的SQL
# 4. 系统资源检查 (INFO/WARNING/CRITICAL级别) - CPU、内存状态
# 5. 磁盘空间检查 (INFO/WARNING/CRITICAL级别) - 磁盘使用情况
# 6. 综合健康总结 (INFO级别) - 整体状态汇总

### 19. 测试代码优化效果验证
# 验证ProcessListMapper重构后的功能
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/status
Accept: application/json

